rovisional","interpretation_note":"依本段人物敘述及相應早期文獻確定。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-080-wangxizhi-family:line120:m0009","start":9,"end":10,"surface":"映","person_id":"972_dh9_hz4","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依本段人物敘述及相應早期文獻確定。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-080-wangxizhi-family:line120:m0024","start":24,"end":25,"surface":"邁","person_id":"972_dh9_hz4","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依本段人物敘述及相應早期文獻確定。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-080-wangxizhi-family:line120:m0040","start":40,"end":42,"surface":"郭璞","person_id":"2i5_4eo_tve","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依本段人物敘述及相應早期文獻確定。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-080-wangxizhi-family:line120:m0043","start":43,"end":44,"surface":"璞","person_id":"2i5_4eo_tve","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依本段人物敘述及相應早期文獻確定。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-080-wangxizhi-family:line120:m0064","start":64,"end":65,"surface":"璞","person_id":"2i5_4eo_tve","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依本段人物敘述及相應早期文獻確定。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-080-wangxizhi-family:line120:m0088","start":88,"end":90,"surface":"鮑靚","person_id":"o8f_bqq_bot","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依本段人物敘述及相應早期文獻確定。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-080-wangxizhi-family:line120:m0100","start":100,"end":101,"surface":"邁","person_id":"972_dh9_hz4","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依本段人物敘述及相應早期文獻確定。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-080-wangxizhi-family:line120:m0145","start":145,"end":148,"surface":"陳安世","person_id":"vsw_zrw_jq6","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依本段人物敘述及相應早期文獻確定。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-080-wangxizhi-family:line120:m0149","start":149,"end":152,"surface":"茅季偉","person_id":"bmq_1ux_rtf","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依本段人物敘述及相應早期文獻確定。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-080-wangxizhi-family:line120:m0204","start":204,"end":206,"surface":"孫氏","person_id":"4xl_1hw_6cg_A","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依本段人物敘述及相應早期文獻確定。"}],"source_position":{"first_line":120,"last_line":120,"raw_start":7314,"raw_end":7545,"revision_id":2603570},"chapter_id":"c-jinshu-080-wangxizhi-family","book_id":"b-jinshu-080","work_id":"w-jinshu","source_id":"s-jinshu-080-wangxizhi-family"},{"id":"c-jinshu-080-wangxizhi-family:line122","text":"初采藥於桐廬縣之桓山，餌術涉三年，時欲斷穀。以此山近人，不得專一，四面籓之，好道之徒欲相見者，登樓與語，以此為樂。常服氣，一氣千餘息。永和二年，移入臨安西山，登岩茹芝，眇爾自得，有終焉之志。乃改名玄，字遠遊。與婦書告別，又著詩十二首，論神仙之事焉。羲之造之，未嘗不彌日忘歸，相與為世外之交。玄遺羲之書云：「自山陰南至臨安，多有金堂玉室，仙人芝草，左元放之徒，漢末諸得道者皆在焉。」羲之自為之傳，述靈異之跡甚多，不可詳記。玄自後莫測所終，好道者皆謂之羽化矣。","text_layer":"received_chapter","annotation_status":"reviewed","mentions":[{"id":"c-jinshu-080-wangxizhi-family:line122:m0098","start":98,"end":99,"surface":"玄","person_id":"972_dh9_hz4","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依本段人物敘述及相應早期文獻確定。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-080-wangxizhi-family:line122:m0101","start":101,"end":103,"surface":"遠遊","person_id":"972_dh9_hz4","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依本段人物敘述及相應早期文獻確定。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-080-wangxizhi-family:line122:m0124","start":124,"end":126,"surface":"羲之","person_id":"326_faf_cd3","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依本段人物敘述及相應早期文獻確定。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-080-wangxizhi-family:line122:m0145","start":145,"end":146,"surface":"玄","person_id":"972_dh9_hz4","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依本段人物敘述及相應早期文獻確定。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-080-wangxizhi-family:line122:m0147","start":147,"end":149,"surface":"羲之","person_id":"326_faf_cd3","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依本段人物敘述及相應早期文獻確定。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-080-wangxizhi-family:line122:m0173","start":173,"end":176,"surface":"左元放","person_id":"nqv_68w_t1g","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依本段人物敘述及相應早期文獻確定。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-080-wangxizhi-f